$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrwnorm  LOC_AFTER=?

* The induced-character step (LargeSieve W_norm_eq): for a primitive character Y mod F and the squarefree cofactor Q / F coprime to F, the squared modulus of the twisted average of the induced inverse character over the coprime residues mod Q is F times the squared modulus of the Y-twisted window sum.

